@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@unit = A102
@paymentKey = {{unit}}-002

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create invoice
# @name createInvoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unit": "{{unit}}",
  "due_date": "2026-09-01",
  # "due_date": "2026-08-01",
  # "due_date": "2026-07-01",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Common Fee", "amount_thb": 1500 },
    { "description": "Water Fee", "amount_thb": 300 }
  ]
}

### Get invoices by unit (edit @unit above; repeat after payment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?unit={{unit}}

### Get first page of invoices (default 50, maximum 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices

### Next page (replace after_id with the last ID from the previous page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?limit=50&after_id=100&unit={{unit}}

### Create payment
# Reuse this key to retry the same payment; change it for a new payment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{paymentKey}}

{
  "unit": "{{unit}}",
  "amount_thb": 400
}
